MISSION

Turn the existing read-only local/foreign filesystem foundation into the first
small mutable filesystem interaction slice.

This Work Order establishes the domain distinctions required for later software
acquisition:

FILE
≠ SOFTWARE PACKAGE
≠ INSTALLED SOFTWARE
≠ RUNNING PROCESS

and proves one concrete cross-Device file transfer operation.

The goal is NOT yet to implement NodeScan Experimental, installation, Inspect,
executables, mining, remote Processes, permissions or a package manager.

The goal is to make a foreign filesystem capable of containing a meaningful
transferable software artifact and make local/remote Files and Terminal observe
the resulting canonical filesystem mutation.


