Extend the current filesystem model only as far as required to represent:

A) text files
B) one concrete software-package file kind

Prefer a small discriminated representation consistent with current code.

Conceptually only:

TextFile
- kind: text
- path
- content

SoftwarePackageFile
- kind: software_package
- path
- represented package metadata

Exact naming may adapt to the repository.

Do NOT introduce:

- generic MIME systems
- arbitrary blob systems
- generic artifact framework
- inode model
- file permissions
- ownership/groups
- timestamps
- symlinks
- filesystem mounts
- universal VFS abstractions


