Example:

download /opt/packages/nodescan-exp-1.1.pkg /home/user/downloads/nodescan-exp-1.1.pkg

It must delegate to the shared canonical transfer operation.

Terminal must not implement filesystem mutation itself.

Do NOT add transfer progress animation.


11. OPTIONAL UPLOAD COMMAND

Only if reverse transfer is included cleanly:

