Again:

Terminal
→ shared transfer operation
→ canonical Device-owned filesystems

No duplicate command-specific file copy logic.


12. TRANSFERS ARE NOT PROCESSES IN V1

A file transfer is immediate in this slice.

Do not create a Process merely to display progress.

The simulation currently lacks represented:

- file size
- bandwidth
- network throughput
- transfer rate

Therefore a timed transfer would be fake telemetry.

Future transfer Processes may become valid once those causes are represented.


